{"ticker":{"symbol":"486510.KQ","name":"글로벌테크놀로지","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":5360.0,"change_pct":0.04280155642023353,"market_cap":105303334912.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":29750.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Hwaseong-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.glbltech.com","business_summary":"Global Technologies Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacture and sale of electronic components. The company's products include display driver; analog and hybrid LED light intensity control integrated circuits applied to premium display products, including mini LED TVs and monitors; digital signage, such as transparent displays for commercial advertising and automotive interiors; Automotive Displays, including CID (Central Information Display) and SAL (Smart Ambient Light); and semiconductor manufacturing, such as core semiconductor and components and various solutions for IT and automotive electronics. Global Technologies Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2013 and is headquartered in Hwaseong-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"글로벌테크놀로지스(Global Technologies Co., Ltd.)는 전자부품의 제조 및 판매를 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사의 제품에는 디스플레이 드라이버가 포함됩니다. 미니 LED TV, 모니터 등 프리미엄 디스플레이 제품에 적용되는 아날로그 및 하이브리드 LED 광량 제어 집적회로; 상업 광고 및 자동차 인테리어용 투명 디스플레이와 같은 디지털 간판; CID(중앙 정보 디스플레이) 및 SAL(스마트 주변 조명)을 포함한 자동차 디스플레이; 핵심반도체 및 부품, IT, 자동차 전장부품 등 다양한 솔루션 등 반도체 제조 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 글로벌테크놀로지스(Global Technologies Co., Ltd.)는 2013년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 화성에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"반도체 장비·소재","financials":[{"period":"2023","revenue":12948115370.0,"operating_income":3082617550.0,"net_income":2970916600.0,"eps":247.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":24276801290.0,"operating_income":-2003742470.0,"net_income":-60146